{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23042","main_id":23042,"main_title":"沙上花·余香","main_description":"内尔敏似乎又在研究着什么东西…","chapter_title":"沙上花·余香","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2304201,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2304201,"sequence":5,"variant":0,"line_id":230420106,"next_line_ids":[230420107],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4405,"speaker_text_hash":2449165800,"speaker":"内尔敏","speaker_raw":"内尔敏","text_hash":2648392682,"text":"旅行者，我问你啊…你听说过「香水」这种东西吗？","raw_text":"旅行者，我问你啊…你听说过「香水」这种东西吗？","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2304201.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-23042","main_id":23042,"main_title":"沙上花·余香","main_description":"内尔敏似乎又在研究着什么东西…","chapter_title":"沙上花·余香","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":2304201,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":2304201,"sequence":6,"variant":0,"line_id":230420107,"next_line_ids":[230420108],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":4405,"speaker_text_hash":2449165800,"speaker":"内尔敏","speaker_raw":"内尔敏","text_hash":3327630306,"text":"贾瓦希尔奶奶告诉我，她年轻的时候经常自制「香水」…","raw_text":"贾瓦希尔奶奶告诉我，她年轻的时候经常自制「香水」…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/2304201.json"}
